<title>CANADA: DBRS confirms Manitoba debt ratings.</title>
<headline>DBRS confirms Manitoba debt ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service on Monday confirmed the ratings of the province of Manitoba's long-term debt at A and short term debt at R-1 (low) with stable trends.</p>
</text>
